      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افتجل أَمْرًا</span></b> , (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْرَهُ</span>, (Ibn-'Abbád, O,)
<i>He forged</i> [<i>a case</i> or <i>matter</i> &amp;c., or <i>his case</i> &amp;c.];
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِخْتَلَقَهُ</span>; (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K;) and <i>invented
it,</i> or <i>excogitated it;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِخْتَرَعَهُ</span>. (Ibn-'Abbád, O.)

